				;no kissing exp (to track her first kissing I guess? or maybe because it was unconscious it doesn't count)
				;寝顔をのぞき込まれた
			CASE 3
				PRINTFORMDL 깨어나자, 당신의 눈앞에 유우기(Yuugi)의 얼굴이 보인다.
